{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"承接 H44–H46 对仍想靠近、回应无把握及失落疲惫的既有区分，并用 M1 说明克制为何无法消除需要，没有新增前史或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复加力仍无支点、事情的分量未减及急迫难与郑重分开，都由 H6、H18、H21 支撑；音乐描写只是听感比喻，心理因果仍落在既有的承受过程上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"将压力累积后自我检查逐渐失去控制力写成局部心理桥，承接 H18、H21、H23、H46 及 M36、M37、M50，没有新增事件或赋予人物新的胜算。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体越过自我检查门槛、部分力量由压抑转向实际靠近，是接在 H19、H20、H44–H46 上的具体心理过程；解脱仍只是暂时摆脱悬置，而非获得保证或决定永远硬撑，没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了想靠近却缺乏回应把握、压力如何累积，以及为何最终向前的心理因果链，即使不看独立的听感记录，也能理解人物的内在变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df3753a4-e882-464c-a097-05a0707f473b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135922058961Z", "elapsed_seconds": 182.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:02:24.987530+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90e41b10c7df58f5eb9f344ceda61f09a3133c6e7bd0fe01293aa510fc9ed18b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initial